WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:09.420
Lord have mercy, Lord have 
mercy, Lord have mercy.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.770
<i>Why is Kevin doing this?</i>

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.000
Young Master...

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.660
I had no idea you were 
an ordained minister.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.240
My mother came from a clerical family.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.350
Though, originally, my elder brother 
was to inherit the Cecil ministry.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.140
Elder brother?

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:32.670
Yes.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.630
Sadly, he died in the Crimean War.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:39.340
I see. But how did you end up here?

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.150
I received word from my mother recently,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.260
informing me that Stradford was 
looking for a new campus pastor.

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.440
That makes sense...

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.360
But you're supposed to be my—

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.990
Before you continue, 
I must ask a favor of you.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:54.400
Yes?

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:59.650
Here on campus, I am Pastor Cecil.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.700
Please try to avoid speaking 
to me about personal matters.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.610
Every night with this!

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:05.750
Get out of my sight! 
Go back to your nest!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.710
Your senses have gotten sharp.

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.710
Scram!

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:08.620
Good for you.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.770
Prefect, we need you!

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.990
This your fault!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.640
Ouch, ouch!

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.210
Why me?! You were horsing around, too!

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:19.040
Hey, what's all the—

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.510
Who broke the window?

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.410
The dorm mother, Maria Mollins.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:28.940
What's the matter? Can't you speak?

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.130
Hey...

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:31.820
Yeah, but...

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:37.190
Very well. I'll go tell the 
Headmaster who's responsible.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.170
<b>Gasp!</b>

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.790
Or rather, I'd like to,

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.650
but let's get that cut treated first.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.260
Come with me.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.080
Yes, ma'am.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.480
I'll let you handle it from here, Twining.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.340
Twenty lines in Latin for the both of you!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.800
Camio...

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.220
I'll see you soon.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:15.480
Hey, you think Miss Mollins 
told the Headmaster?

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:18.860
He hasn't called for us yet, 
so I don't think so.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:22.280
So it is actually Miss and not Missus, right?

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.570
She's an old maid.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.620
I think she at least had a fiancé.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.240
She's got a picture in her room.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:29.720
Oh?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:34.080
Come to think of it, when 
did she start working here?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.400
Maybe two months ago?

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:40.860
For only being here two months, 
she sure is close with the Headmaster.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:46.140
Oh yeah, I've heard she lived in the
dorms with her family a long time ago.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.070
Yeah?

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.680
The three from yesterday...

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:54.420
I know! Let's search Miss Mollins's 
room and find some dirt on her!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:55.250
What?!

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.560
If it works, we could keep her from 
telling the Headmaster about us!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.150
Ahem.

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:05.200
The boat race is tomorrow. 
Get changed and go to practice!

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.470
Right!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.530
Honestly, these silly pranks...

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.390
The underclassmen are so cute,
with their little pranks.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.640
They did this while I was sleeping.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.570
Is that supposed to be the style now?

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:39.870
Among certain circles.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:43.360
Anyway, keep an eye out—

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:46.530
Hey...

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.450
What is that hoard of candy?

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.100
Where'd you get all that?!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.790
Wh-What about you? Shouldn't 
you be at boating practice?!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.210
We're gonna win!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.420
Yeah!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.110
<b>Thunk</b>

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.230
Bloody demon...

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.490
Hurry, hurry!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:14.710
Wait up!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:15.930
Them again...

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:19.000
I told them to get to boating practice!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.520
Then again, I'd rather not go to practice, either.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.740
<i>But, where should I hide?</i>

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.870
<i>The church is...</i>

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:54.470
<i>The Head Boy?</i>

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.590
<i>He lives in the Headmaster's House. 
What's he doing in Jacob House?</i>

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.280
Miss Mollins? Is something wrong?

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.330
Miss Mollins?

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:15.300
I'm coming in!

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.440
Are you all right, Miss Mollins?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:23.790
Ca...mio...

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.400
Huh?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.600
Are you all right?

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:31.460
I'm fine.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.180
I was just looking for something...

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.540
<i>A magic circle?</i>

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:41.420
Must be my age...

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:45.400
Perhaps I should follow your lead 
and have an afternoon nap?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.270
<i>She got me.</i>

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.690
I'll overlook it this time,

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:56.130
but I expect Jacob House to bring
home the trophy tomorrow in return.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.330
Men of Jacob House!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.790
The boat race is finally upon us!

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:09.240
Miss Mollins has promised 
us all meat pie if we win!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:10.410
Huzzah!

00:08:10.410 --> 00:08:12.500
Do you men want to fill your bellies?!

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.720
Yes!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.660
Do you want that meat pie?!

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.600
Yes!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.760
I wanna go home...

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:21.110
Then go, and secure victory for Jacob House!

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:23.550
Victory!

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:47.650
This is a surprise. Are you entering, too?

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.600
I'm not much for rowing,

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.550
but since it's part of my 
grade, I've got no choice.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.290
That's like you.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:57.990
Who's that guy?

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.180
Watch your tongue! He's the Head Boy!

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.230
He's got such an easy life, even I'm jealous.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.070
"Yes, I was Head Boy. What of it?"

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.340
"Yes, I was the cream of the crop. What of it?"

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.220
He can brag about it for the rest of his life.

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.280
Watch out for him.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:15.820
Huh?

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.240
There's something suspicious...

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.200
You're one to talk!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:25.510
He's the Head Boy, the most elite 
of the elite. Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.470
Have you forgotten?

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.470
You haven't chosen anyone yet.

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.550
It's very likely someone will target you again.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:38.920
Just be vigilant.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.910
You can't mean...

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:55.660
One-two, one-two!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.530
More pitch, more pitch!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:58.970
Yay!

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.030
Go, go!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:03.450
Hey, doctor stop, doctor stop!

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:06.000
Ungh, I feel awful...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.210
Good effort...

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:11.040
Team Twining of Jacob House is out!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:16.010
Stroke, stroke!

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.130
Dantalion and the Head Boy 
are fighting for first!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:44.410
They're gonna crash!

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.580
That was close...

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.330
How crazy was that? 
It curved at the last second!

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:07.860
Are you okay?

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.110
I was right.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:14.080
Nathan Caxton, you are a demon.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:16.750
Not only that...

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.450
Enough, Dantalion! You're being rude!

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:37.250
<i>Impossible...</i>

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.180
<i>The Head Boy can't be a demon...</i>

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:47.630
<i>I should talk to Kevin about this... But...</i>

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:48.910
Come to pray?

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.290
That's a good lad.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.340
No... Excuse me.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.690
Father.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.910
A word with you, if I may?

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:09.870
What can I do for you?

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.830
Big news!

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:16.030
We figured out Miss Mollins's secret!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:19.840
Believe it or not, Miss Mollins is a witch!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.080
A witch?

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.520
It's true!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.770
She had spell books in 
her room and everything!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.130
So you snuck into our dorm mother's room,

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.990
and stole something to boot?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.560
B-But...

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.380
I saw it!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:36.190
Miss Mollins was trying to summon a demon!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.980
<i>Does this mean...</i>

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:39.760
<i>That circle...</i>

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:42.950
No.

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:46.190
Now, you three need to reflect 
on what you've done!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:48.950
And I'll see to it you're punished 
until you learn your lesson.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.180
I hope you're ready!

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.160
Aww!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.640
Don't "aww" me!

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.100
Young Master, what perfect timing!

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.500
Kevin?

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.900
You were the one who told me 
to keep my distance. What is it?

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.510
This is more important.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:10.470
It's about Miss Mollins.

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.600
She came to say a final prayer...

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.640
William!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.020
Emergency!

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.310
Hurry!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.480
What is it?

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.870
Just hurry!

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:26.360
What happened?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.240
A portal to Hell just appeared.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:33.260
And Miss Mollins was the one who opened it.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:41.770
Write my name in the tome of 
black, the tome of death.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:50.540
Present your sacrifice and sip its blood, 
in atonement for your past sins.

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.820
Miss Mollins, stop this!

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.820
Elect me and I'll save her.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.530
I already told you, I'm not choosing anyone!

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:26.880
The Head Boy?!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:31.420
I knew it. You are Camio, aren't you?

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.080
Same as ever.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:38.430
Even though you're only a halfling, 
you're still absurdly strong.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.400
Dantalion?

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.360
Silence, Nephilim. 
You abandoned your humanity.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:47.130
Head Boy, you're...

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.360
One of Solomon's pillars.

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.430
A Great President of Hell,

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:55.820
ruling over 30 demon armies and 
ranked 53rd in the demon hierarchy,

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.790
a protégé of Beelzebub,

00:14:58.230 --> 00:15:01.500
and the third candidate to 
be interim ruler, Camio.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:05.050
He's no ordinary demon, either.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:07.790
Born of a human's womb,

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:11.010
he is half human, what we call a "halfling."

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.310
Camio, isn't it funny?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:19.200
You haven't changed a bit.

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:23.520
But I've turned into an old woman...

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:26.730
Maria...

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.760
I wanted to see you one 
last time before I died.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:35.950
I knew that if I came to live in 
Jacob House, I'd get my chance.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:39.270
Because it's where we first met...

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:46.340
Long ago, my whole family lived 
and worked in Jacob House.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.630
<i>Are you hurt?</i>

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.080
<i>Are you all right?</i>

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.730
<i>You're not afraid of me?</i>

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.490
<i>The pastor at church was a liar.</i>

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:22.190
You were a very kind, and very lonely, demon.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.650
<i>Maria!</i>

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.810
<i>Father, Mother!</i>

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:43.980
<i>Father!</i>

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.220
<i>Camio!</i>

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.160
<i>Maria!</i>

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:00.700
<i>He's a demon...</i>

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:01.910
<i>Maria!</i>

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.530
<i>Get back here!</i>

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:06.910
<i>Why? Camio's not a bad demon!</i>

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.390
<i>Maria!</i>

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.680
<i>Let's live together.</i>

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:22.440
<i>Somewhere far, far away from here...</i>

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.100
<i>Maria...</i>

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:28.560
<i>I'll go anywhere, as long as I'm with you.</i>

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.580
<i>Thank you, Maria...</i>

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.530
But...

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.350
You didn't come for me.

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:48.130
I understand why, now.

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:54.090
Time flows differently for you and me.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:58.090
And you are a kind demon.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.680
Why did you try to summon a demon?

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:10.200
Last year, I fell ill with a lung disease, 
and was told that I don't have long left.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.480
When I realized I would die alone...

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:18.500
It's selfish of me, but it made me sad.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:24.670
I thought, if I formed a pact with a demon,

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.330
Camio,

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.290
I could become one, like you.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.760
I knew about you returning to the academy,

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:40.330
and that you tried to contract with demons.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:44.540
And... I wavered.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:51.520
I've walked the earth alone for 
more years than I can count.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:56.070
Yet my demon blood prevents me 
from truly living as a man,

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.890
while my human half leaves me with
no place in Hell to call my own.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:07.500
But if you become a demon 
and live by my side...

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:10.910
She'd be a Nephilim.

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:14.400
She's only got a few years left.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.190
Let her die as a human.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.670
Camio...

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:21.660
If you have any humanity left in your heart...

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.470
My poor, sweet demon...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.920
Soon, I will be gone.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.900
Is there no one else who can be there for you?

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:38.700
No one.

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:43.870
From the day I was born, 
I've had no one. Even Solomon died.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.420
<i>Do you truly detest demons so?</i>

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:55.230
<i>Even as their blood flows in your veins?</i>

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.860
<i>Become mine.</i>

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.800
<i>Do so, and none shall deny you.</i>

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.240
<i>Neither man, nor demon...</i>

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.390
<i>Nor God Himself.</i>

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.240
Why not just stay here?

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.140
Maria...

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:28.530
You'll have lots of friends.

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.710
Miss Mollins...

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.520
Please go into treatment.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:40.830
For your own sake... and for his.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.780
You're right.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.700
Um, Miss Mollins...

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:06.520
Here.

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:09.670
Ah, so you three had this?

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:10.770
I'm sorry.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.750
We're sorry.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:15.710
But, um...

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:20.730
The man in your picture looks 
like the Head Boy, doesn't he?

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:24.680
Curious, isn't it?

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:28.680
The dorm mother's quitting, isn't she?

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.640
Yes.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.030
She's leaving to get treatment for her illness.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:37.550
Aww, I was hoping I'd get to 
eat some of her meat pie.

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:38.980
It's so good!

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.290
How would you know when 
you've never had it?

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.160
The Head Boy told me. He said her 
cooking's always been delicious.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.660
Rose-colored glasses...

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:54.730
For a candidate, he seems to 
have plenty of time to waste

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:56.200
pining for a human.

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:43.810
You weak, foolish humans 
should all just die.

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:47.100
Except for the ones who bake 
those delicious scones,

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:49.610
madeleines, tarts, and macaroons.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.260
Greetings, everyone.

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:55.470
Did you know "Raindrop" is a piano piece?
